invariant: INV-14
file: src/srv.c
catches: srv_auth_test
reason: a server takes a ticket_key_previous with cookie_key's bytes, one
  key for an HMAC and an AEAD, which srv_cfg.h forbids.
  test/srv_identity_tests.h's test_previous_ticket_key passes the same
  array and a copy of it, and requires CH_EINVAL for both
  (docs/decisions.md 220).

--- old
    return ticket_key_own(srv->ticket_key_previous, srv->cookie_key) &&
--- new
    return !ct_memeq(srv->ticket_key_previous, unfilled_key, sizeof unfilled_key) &&
